    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"feeling\" or a symptom. it's the truth. i know who i am. i did something that can't be fixed and i can't just \"talk\" my way out of it. how can you say people want to help when the reality is that i've fundamentally broken things? it feels like i'm just pretending to be part of society when i know i don't deserve it.",
