      "content": "i don't want to change. i don't want to \"navigate\" anything. why is it so important to you that i keep trying? it feels like you're just trying to force me to keep living a lie. if someone is truly a burden, or truly broken, shouldn't the most honest thing be to just let it go? shouldn't there be a way to just stop the cycle?",
